<article class="env-lemma" id="05SL">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/05SL">Lemma <span data-tag="05SL">12.19.6</span>.</a> Let $\mathcal{A}$ be an abelian category. Let $f : B \to A$ be a strict epimorphism of filtered objects. Let $g : C \to A$ be a morphism of filtered objects. Then $f \oplus g : B \oplus C \to A$ is a strict epimorphism. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      Clear from the definitions. 
